    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n52561" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κᾰλαῦροψ</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οπος</span>,
			ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>shepherd's staff</i> or <i>crook</i>, which was thrown
			so as to drive back the cattle to the herd, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				23.845
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Antim.
				61
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.R.
				2.33
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				6.106
			</span></i> (<span class="entity">Zonas</span>), <i><span class="en">
				<u>APl.</u>
				4.74
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.H.
				1.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Longus
				1.8
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>BSA</u>
				16.107
			</span></i> (Pamphylia, <span class="entity">ii/iii A.D.</span>). (Prob. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καλά-ϝροψ</span>, from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Ϝρέπω</span>, 
				v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ῥέπω</span>
			: but the first part of the word is uncertain.)</div>
